1
0:00:00,450 --> 0:00:01,260
A transfer-on-death

2
0:00:01,260 --> 0:00:02,880
deed names who gets

3
0:00:02,880 --> 0:00:04,500
your house when you

4
0:00:04,500 --> 0:00:04,900
die.

5
0:00:04,900 --> 0:00:06,120
That house passes

6
0:00:06,120 --> 0:00:06,930
outside probate.

7
0:00:06,930 --> 0:00:08,540
But there are three

8
0:00:08,540 --> 0:00:08,950
catches.

9
0:00:09,350 --> 0:00:09,700
One.

10
0:00:10,710 --> 0:00:11,510
It has to be

11
0:00:11,510 --> 0:00:12,370
recorded with the

12
0:00:12,370 --> 0:00:13,750
county before you die.

13
0:00:14,830 --> 0:00:16,050
In Texas and Utah,

14
0:00:16,770 --> 0:00:17,910
a signed deed that

15
0:00:17,910 --> 0:00:19,010
was never recorded

16
0:00:19,010 --> 0:00:20,370
does not work.

17
0:00:21,170 --> 0:00:21,520
Two.

18
0:00:22,290 --> 0:00:23,170
Your debts can follow

19
0:00:23,170 --> 0:00:23,690
the house.

20
0:00:24,370 --> 0:00:25,210
If your estate cannot

21
0:00:25,210 --> 0:00:25,950
pay what it owes,

22
0:00:26,210 --> 0:00:26,870
the estate can go

23
0:00:26,870 --> 0:00:27,690
after that property.

24
0:00:28,610 --> 0:00:29,650
Utah allows twelve

25
0:00:29,650 --> 0:00:30,590
months to start.

26
0:00:31,530 --> 0:00:32,030
Hawaii allows

27
0:00:32,030 --> 0:00:32,470
eighteen.

28
0:00:33,600 --> 0:00:33,950
Three.

29
0:00:34,880 --> 0:00:36,280
In Texas, a will

30
0:00:36,280 --> 0:00:37,360
cannot change it.

31
0:00:37,740 --> 0:00:38,740
To undo the deed,

32
0:00:38,900 --> 0:00:39,640
you record a new

33
0:00:39,640 --> 0:00:40,660
one, or a written

34
0:00:40,660 --> 0:00:41,880
cancellation, before

35
0:00:41,880 --> 0:00:42,420
you die.

36
0:00:43,240 --> 0:00:44,400
So check three things.

37
0:00:45,060 --> 0:00:45,780
Is this deed allowed

38
0:00:45,780 --> 0:00:46,420
in your state?

39
0:00:47,060 --> 0:00:47,840
Is it recorded?

40
0:00:48,640 --> 0:00:49,420
Does it still name

41
0:00:49,420 --> 0:00:50,160
the right person?

42
0:00:51,280 --> 0:00:51,860
This is general

43
0:00:51,860 --> 0:00:53,940
information, not legal

44
0:00:53,940 --> 0:00:54,380
advice.

